<section class="adminBillingGrid"><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS POLICY</span><h2>Dunning & trial settings</h2><form method="post" class="stack"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="op" value="settings"><label>Grace period days<input type="number" min="0" max="60" name="dunning_grace_days" value="<?=h((string)$settings['dunning_grace_days'])?>"></label><label>Trial reminder window<input type="number" min="1" max="30" name="trial_reminder_days" value="<?=h((string)$settings['trial_reminder_days'])?>"></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="suspend_after_grace" value="1" <?=!empty($settings['suspend_after_grace'])?'checked':''?>> Suspend account access after grace expires</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="restore_after_payment" value="1" <?=!empty($settings['restore_after_payment'])?'checked':''?>> Restore V1.60-owned suspension after payment recovery</label><button>Save policy</button></form><p class="meta">Automatic suspension is off by default. Manual lifecycle changes always take precedence over dunning restoration.</p></article>
